dian-tenant-posts-harassment-videos-after-clash-with-indian-landlady-over-barbecue-claims-she-was-arrested-by-surrey-police/articleshow/134082162.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-11T23:10:59+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134082375,imgsize-79508.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['We will never, ever forget': Trump commemorates 25th anniversary of 9/11 terrorist attacks]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134080822.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[On the anniversary of 9/11, leaders across the United States honored the victims and reflected on the impact of the tragedy on current foreign policy. Speaking at the Pentagon, President Trump paid homage to the fallen and reaffirmed the nation’s determination, particularly in its dealings with Iran. Defense Secretary Hegseth reinforced this message, relating the historical attacks to the ongoing war on terror.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/we-will-never-ever-forget-trump-commemorates-25th-anniversary-of-9/11-terrorist-attacks/articleshow/134080822.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/we-will-never-ever-forget-trump-commemorates-25th-anniversary-of-9/11-terrorist-attacks/articleshow/134080822.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-11T22:49:51+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Trisha Mahajan</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134081390,imgsize-77284.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[A 27-year-old Tennessee diesel mechanic wanted to farm full-time; solar sites gave his sheep...]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134076926.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Solar grazing offers new opportunities for small livestock farmers across the American South. This practice uses sheep to manage vegetation beneath solar panels, benefiting both farmers and solar companies. Farmers gain access to pasture and income, while companies reduce maintenance costs and equipment damage risks. A Tennessee mechanic became a full-time farmer after securing grazing access to over 400 acres.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-27-year-old-tennessee-diesel-mechanic-wanted-to-farm-full-time-solar-sites-gave-his-sheep-400-acres-to-graze-letting-him-quit-his-job-and-build-a-300-ewe-flock/articleshow/134076926.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-27-year-old-tennessee-diesel-mechanic-wanted-to-farm-full-time-solar-sites-gave-his-sheep-400-acres-to-graze-letting-him-quit-his-job-and-build-a-300-ewe-flock/articleshow/134076926.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-11T22:51:17+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134081503,imgsize-1381231.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Thames Valley Police uncover £1.3m cannabis farm in abandoned BHS store in Slough with 1,700 plants]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134078515.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Thames Valley Police uncovered a £1.3 million cannabis factory inside a disused BHS store in Slough, finding more than 1,700 plants across two floors. The crop had a potential yield of 150.27kg and an estimated street value of £1.288 million. Two men pleaded guilty and were sentenced to 14 months in prison.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/thames-valley-police-uncover-1-3-million-cannabis-factory-inside-abandoned-bhs-store-in-slough-with-1700-plants-and-potential-150kg-yield-two-men-jailed-for-14-months/articleshow/134078515.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/thames-valley-police-uncover-1-3-million-cannabis-factory-inside-abandoned-bhs-store-in-slough-with-1700-plants-and-potential-150kg-yield-two-men-jailed-for-14-months/articleshow/134078515.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-11T22:03:02+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134078780,imgsize-182905.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Mamdani attends NYC 9/11 memorial despite calls from victims’ families to stay away]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134077205.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/mamdani-attends-nyc-9/11-memorial-despite-calls-from-victims-families-to-stay-away/articleshow/134077205.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/mamdani-attends-nyc-9/11-memorial-despite-calls-from-victims-families-to-stay-away/articleshow/134077205.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-11T22:24:38+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Aashish Vashistha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134079887,imgsize-88508.cms"/></item></channel></rss>